      "sourceHash": "a25231846772dc13",
      "translationZh": "在 PPL 相近的情况下，比 Unsloth/AesSedai Q4 小约 20–30GB。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "258ae2fa96cb80e0",
      "translationZh": "经过几天测试，我发布了一组适用于 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next、兼容主线版本的 imatrix 量化模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6f7d6a102659e852",
      "translationZh": "目标：达到热门 Unsloth / AesSedai Q4 构建版本的同等质量水平，同时减少磁盘和 RAM 占用。具体节省多少取决于你拿哪个文件来比较，大约为 20–30GB。PPL 数据在模型卡中，与这两者相比都具有竞争力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5e4dae621f13a6da",
      "translationZh": "仓库：https://huggingface.co/agentionai/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-AP-GGUF",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "794d8a72b843b62b",
      "translationZh": "我建议先从 Q4 量化版本入手。Q3 和 Q5 即将推出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c63ed88f9a4e7ebc",
      "translationZh": "量化方案是逐层定制的，而不是一刀切地降低 bpw。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c8752fe3d66397b",
      "translationZh": "AMD / Strix Halo：另有独立的 ROCmFP4 构建版本，在该硬件上比 Q4_XS 略好，也更快。（ https://huggingface.co/agentionai/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-ROCmFP4-FAST-imatrix-GGUF ）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b204f372de902a07",
      "translationZh": "如果你试用了，请贴出你使用的量化版本、RAM/VRAM、tok/s，以及你是否感觉质量与 Unsloth IQ4_XS / Q4_K 相当。这才是我关心的比较。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
